menu "Retro-Go"
    config RG_DISPLAY_ACTIVITY
        bool "Track display task activity (rg_display_is_active)"
        default n
        help
            Adds rg_display_is_active(): true from rg_display_submit() until
            the display task has finished that frame, lcd_sync() included
            (rg_display_is_busy() keeps reporting only a non-empty queue).
            Costs one increment per submitted frame and one store per
            displayed frame. Off by default; an application that needs it
            selects it (gbsp's hybrid render does).
    config RG_AUDIO_I2S_EVENTS
        bool "Count I2S DMA buffer events (rg_audio_i2s_get_events)"
        default n
        help
            Installs the legacy I2S driver with an event queue and counts, in
            rg_audio_submit(), the buffers the DMA has played (TX_DONE) and the
            ones it finished while every other buffer was free (TX_Q_OVF), i.e.
            underruns that replay stale data. Diagnostic: adds an ISR queue send
            per DMA buffer. Off by default; gbsp's audio pacing stats select it.
endmenu
